note: 
  --> list-mismatched-elements.wipple:1:11
  |
1 | my-list : 1, "hi", ()
  |           -----------

`1, "hi", ()` is a collection of `Number` elements.

Since the first element, `1`, is a `Number`, the remaining elements must also be a `Number`.

This means `1` must be a `String`, like `"hi"`.

This means `1` must be a `()`, like `()`.

This means `"hi"` must be a `()`, like `()`.

error: 
  --> list-mismatched-elements.wipple:1:20
  |
1 | my-list : 1, "hi", ()
  |                    ^^

`()` is a `Number`, `String`, or a `()`, but it can only be one of these.

